@Lab_01_HostAddress = http://localhost:5184

### Existing weather forecast endpoint
GET {{Lab_01_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### Liveness check
GET {{Lab_01_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Database readiness check (200 healthy / 503 if DB unreachable)
GET {{Lab_01_HostAddress}}/health/db
Accept: application/json

### List all tasks
GET {{Lab_01_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Get one task by id
GET {{Lab_01_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a task (valid)
POST {{Lab_01_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Docker"
}

### Create a task (invalid - empty title, returns 400)
POST {{Lab_01_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

### Mark task 1 as done
PUT {{Lab_01_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1/done
Accept: application/json

###
